WEBVTT

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.310
Qimen Kenzou Shinpou!

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:19.980
I'll see with my own eyes the truth 
hidden behind your Qimen Dunjia.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.510
The months that pass within my dreams

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.430
I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.690
If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:50.150
In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.030
Shangri-la is nowhere to be found

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:59.830
No one knows the love of the spring wind

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:09.040
The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:17.010
Trading places, they bloom then wilt

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.850
In January, I pick a flower with no petals

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:28.190
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.690
In March, the peach blossoms bloom

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:39.660
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.700
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:47.790
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:57.800
<b>10: Fuukou Qimen</b>

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:16.650
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.420
Let's go, Ouya.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:05.320
I'll find the truth behind 
your Qimen Dunjia.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.230
Sei-nii, stop...

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.910
Kan Suidan!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.670
What did you do to me?

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.520
I blocked the pressure point in your chest.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:46.860
Just give up.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:59.500
Not even my Qimen Kenzou Shinpou 
will let me see how it works.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:01.810
Then it can't be helped.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:06.830
You should've surrendered 
when the match be—

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.070
Are you trying to divine my technique?

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.990
Stop, Shokatsu Sei!

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:16.660
Sei-nii...

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.310
Don't be stupid!

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.470
I divined your secret art.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.630
I didn't expect it to 
end this badly, though.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:44.600
It's not that I can't accept defeat.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:51.650
I just can't lose without 
learning the truth.

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:54.050
Not without understanding your secret arts.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.590
<b>"You Piece of Sh*t"</b>

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.630
Such foul words!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.620
Grandmaster, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.540
How dare you make a respectable 
monk say such crude things?!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.020
Y-You're just...

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:14.860
Forget it. I shouldn't have come here at all.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.110
My quiet life is over now.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:25.010
Shokatsu Sei, you're still using your 
Qimen Kenzou Shinpou, aren't you?

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.320
Take another good look with your own eyes.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:38.530
Why do you focus on only me 
when you know I'm a fangshi?

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.880
Look closely at my luopan.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.440
This is an ordinary luopan...

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.430
No!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.190
Do you get it now?

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:02.160
It's not like ordinary Qimen Dunjia 
that's used to divine good or bad fortune

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.080
depending on an object's direction.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:08.340
On this luopan, I am the directions.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.100
I am good and bad luck.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:15.860
Time, space, and the elements of my 
techniques are determined by me.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:19.240
You have total control over 
the structure of your luopan?

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:22.250
Something so illogical should be impossible.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.280
Luopans are bound by time.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.620
Why do you assume I can't?

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.900
Time is simply a way to 
measure changes in things.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.970
Control time, and you can control change.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.240
The gravity in here just changed.
It's now different from outside my luopan.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:46.100
In here, it'll take this 
pebble a minute to fall.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:50.890
You said fangshi avoid misfortune 
and seek good fortune.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.960
With that attitude, you'll never achieve

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:57.330
what your grandfather 
Shokatsu Koumei did.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:02.090
He was known as the world's 
greatest fangshi.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.850
He must have known the 
Shu Han Dynasty would fall.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:09.770
But he abandoned the cause of the fangshi,

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:13.300
resisted the times, and threw 
himself into conflict.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.980
All to save a world that couldn't be saved.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.640
Even though he knew it was impossible,

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.380
he chose to fight the heavens 
for the sake of the people.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:29.510
That is the path a great 
fangshi should follow.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:33.390
If you simply avoid misfortune 
and seek good fortune,

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:38.410
remain bound by the rules of the 
heavens, and go with the flow,

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.030
there's no point in understanding logic.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:47.110
Even if you do understand the laws of 
all things, if you're bound by them,

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.320
then you're no different 
from an ordinary person.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.310
I still have a lot to learn.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:04.240
Ouya-dono, I admit defeat.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.270
Ouya wins!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:13.380
I never thought bukou-style 
Qimen Dunjia user Shokatsu Sei

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.540
would admit defeat so easily.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:19.160
Just who is this Ouya fellow?

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:24.120
Rikukin, you know the name "Fuukou," yes?

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:29.330
The mythical tactician who 
created Qimen Dunjia.

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:33.280
Ouya-dono, there's something 
I want to ask you.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.130
Huh?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.210
What is the name of your Qimen Dunjia?

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.650
We've spoken enough already.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:45.020
If you're still not satisfied, 
divine it yourself.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.640
Next time you're on the brink 
of death, I won't stop you.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:58.110
But there should be no Qimen Dunjia 
that can beat the bukou style.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:03.540
The bukou style is no more than 
one style of Qimen Dunjia.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.740
As for the source of Qimen Dunjia...

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:08.860
Practically no one has ever seen it.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:11.340
One of eight secret arts:

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.550
its name is "Fuukou Qimen."

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:16.850
<b>Fuukou             Qimen</b>

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:22.900
Next match, Fuu Saen versus Ja Seiryan!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:27.790
Saen, I only recently joined the Ten Elders.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:31.030
The others don't respect the Fuu family.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:35.080
I'm sure you want to show them 
the dignity of the Fuu family,

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:38.590
but try to hold back against Ja Seiryan.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.320
There was the matter with his brother, too.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:43.480
I don't want to antagonize 
the Ja family any further.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.940
I know, Dad.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.430
The match will now begin!

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:54.190
Come on, Mom.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.810
I thought it was weird you 
hadn't called for a whole day.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:59.550
Why'd you have to call now?

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:04.520
Yeah, yeah. I'm eating all 
my vegetables every day.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.100
Excuse me... Can we get started?

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.640
I'm not just eating meat, okay?

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:13.130
Jeez, I'm not a kid anymore.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:15.830
I brush my teeth three times a day, too.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.700
I asked if we could get started.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.660
How could you do that?

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:29.090
You broke my phone.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:32.250
My mom will be worried that 
the call suddenly ended!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.630
She'll think I'm hiding something 
or got into some kind of trouble!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.890
She's probably calling 
the police right now!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.420
So let me borrow your phone.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:42.700
Are you stupid?

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.990
What idiot brings their phone to a match?

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.290
Hey, someone!

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:50.020
Let me borrow your phone!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.650
Use this.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.890
I owe you one, old man.

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:55.950
It's fine.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:01.330
Hey, Mom. It's me.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.060
Don't worry. Nothing happened.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.980
I just dropped my phone.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.510
What? Haven't we talked enough?

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:10.300
My opponent's waiting for me right now.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.080
Yeah, a girl.

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:14.910
She looks pretty strong.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:17.050
What? You want to talk to her?

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.500
No way!

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.270
God, you never shut up.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.970
My mom wants to talk to you.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:29.100
Hello? Is this Seiryan-kun's mother?

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:36.220
Yes. Boys never grow up.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:40.710
Yes, that was my intention 
all along. Don't worry.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.700
Oh, no, you're very welcome.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:47.520
She told me to beat you 
up and send you home.

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:51.940
<i>You were going to fight 
that lovely young lady?!</i>

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:54.240
<i>Just let her hit you and come home!</i>

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.660
<i>The village mayor's daughter 
is waiting for you!</i>

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:57.250
<i>Got it?</i>

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.800
Can we start now?

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.470
Yeah.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.020
She dodged them?

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.360
<i>Spatial transference?</i>

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.840
<i>Is that what she did with her fists earlier?</i>

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:20.280
<i>Either side could win this match.</i>

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:25.480
<i>But it's not as though I have no 
chance of beating either of them.</i>

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.240
Hou-nee, will you be able 
to stick to the plan?

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:31.610
No problem.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:32.830
No one will find out.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:35.440
I'm counting on you, then.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.250
Bury Ouya-san for me.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:38.630
You can count on me.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:45.450
The smooth shoulder pole, ah...

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.220
<i>We've arrived at Ryuukosan.</i>

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.670
<i>Sounds like you knew we were coming.</i>

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:54.460
<i>I'm surprised you came when you 
knew we'd be waiting for you.</i>

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:59.480
<i>There's something I want badly 
enough to take the risk.</i>

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.840
<i>Just so you know, I'm not 
interested in you anymore.</i>

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.080
<b></b>Several Months Earlier

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.960
This can't be real!

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:12.940
That's all the information
I got from your grandfather.

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.950
Whether or not you choose 
to believe it is up to you.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:17.830
Wait, Ro Ryou.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.060
Give me your number.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.730
You say such interesting things.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:29.690
Are you serious about keeping in touch 
with a member of Zensei like myself?

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:34.470
I just want to keep in touch with 
the person known as Ro Ryou.

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.740
Zensei has nothing to do with this.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:40.650
Don't tell me you don't 
know how evil we are.

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.490
Evil? You're not evil.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.700
A murderer deals in human lives.

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:50.540
A financial criminal deals in currency.

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:54.610
But you destroy society's order.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:59.510
You've trampled on every 
aspect it until now.

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:04.210
Chou Soran, why don't you join Zensei?

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:06.930
You seem like you'd be pretty useful.

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.720
I'm not interested.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:11.920
I'm satisfied with my current life.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:16.870
We'll only exchange messages, 
not phone calls.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.890
Delete my messages as soon 
as you finish reading them.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:27.010
<i>I met your family the other day.</i>

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.260
<i>They said they wanted to see you.</i>

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.160
<i>You mean my corpse.</i>

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.790
Do you know what Ro Ryou 
did to the Ro family?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:41.420
That animal murdered my younger sister.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:43.510
He killed his own family!

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:47.770
<i>Is what he said true?</i>

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.430
<i>I didn't do it. I was framed.</i>

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:56.190
<i>Framed? By who?</i>

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.590
You've been on the defensive for a while.

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:03.570
Why not admit defeat?

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.810
If I win, my next opponent is Fuu Houhou.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.210
I can finally avenge my brother.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.300
That odd woman again?

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:18.920
I was there when your brother was defeated.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:23.440
But why don't you stop making excuses?

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:27.580
You just don't want to live 
according to your mother's rules.

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:32.520
If you really wanted to avenge him, 
then you would risk your life against me!

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:42.290
It certainly is lame for someone as old 
as you to do as their parents say.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:48.230
But if your parents are exceptional, 
then it's an easy way to live.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.750
If they're more experienced 
and talented than we are,

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.380
then why shouldn't we follow 
the path they set out for us?

00:14:57.650 --> 00:15:00.600
Listen to your mother and go home.

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:04.220
I'll beat Fuu Houhou for you.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:05.550
No!

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:08.330
Saen-san, please surrender.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.720
I don't want to harm a girl.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:15.550
It's impressive that you were 
able to push me this far,

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.310
but I can't back down now.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.820
I have to be the one to beat Fuu Houhou!

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.470
She's my prey!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.470
They're chasing me?

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:37.480
You're the first one to 
make me use all my knives.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:40.290
But now that I have, you're—

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.460
<i>From the ground?</i>

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.000
<i>She went after my blind spot!</i>

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.800
Looks like you refuse to 
listen to your mother.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.760
I didn't think you'd be this strong.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:59.890
I shouldn't have bothered 
to warn you earlier.

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:02.820
I underestimated you, too.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:38.050
<i>I wasn't expecting a son of the 
Ja family to be this strong.</i>

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.630
<i>Don't push yourself too hard, Saen.</i>

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:45.060
<i>Your life is more important than 
the Fuu family's standing.</i>

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:52.030
Saen, not too much.

00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:00.190
So the old guy's your dad, huh?

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:05.780
Looks like I'm not the only one 
being coddled by their parents.

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:09.310
If you claim to live according 
to your parents' wishes,

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.010
why don't you leave this arena already?

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:16.710
Yes, of course I'd listen to my father.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:19.650
But he only told me not to hit your face

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:24.220
so hard that your mother 
wouldn't recognize you!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:29.020
<i>Saen, why are you so invested in this match?</i>

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:33.030
<i>Damn it. I used too much ki that time.</i>

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.990
<i>I need to finish her off 
with my next attack.</i>

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.690
<i>My stamina won't last much longer.</i>

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:39.900
<i>I'll have to use that technique.</i>

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.630
<i>I wanted to save it for Fuu Houhou...</i>

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:49.930
<i>She's extending her ki pretty far.</i>

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:54.690
<i>She'll be able to keenly sense the locations 
of my knives from this distance.</i>

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:59.170
<i>In that case, I'll channel 
more ki into my Zansentou.</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.900
<i>I'll get the friction between them and 
the air as close to zero as possible.</i>

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:07.590
<i>No matter how far she extends her ki, 
she won't be able to dodge them.</i>

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:11.640
Saen-san, one last question.

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.560
Would you care to surrender?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:20.500
The technique I'm about to use goes 
far beyond what this match calls for.

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.590
You just worry about yourself.

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:28.240
I haven't completely mastered 
the technique I'm about to use.

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:29.760
Who knows what will happen?

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.590
Enough, Saen!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.120
This match isn't worth 
risking your life for!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:04.450
A draw?

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:05.280
Saen!

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:11.260
I'm fine, Dad.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:17.050
Sheesh. Is that how it is?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.380
Huh?

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:23.550
I thought you'd extended your 
ki to detect my knives.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:29.430
But you were able to link the 
space within your range.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.620
It was worth it.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:37.850
If you'd created the exits somewhere 
else, I would've suffered a fatal wound.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:42.690
You, too. You didn't aim for my vital spots.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.120
Your knives were fast.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:49.010
I couldn't transfer all of them.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.960
I'm still standing because 
I wasn't cut deep.

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:56.600
But what were you thinking,
holding back at the very end?

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.650
I'm not sure, either.

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.780
I can't believe I made it 
this far only to lose.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:08.550
My body's a wreck, too.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.310
You should've listened to your mom.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:16.640
She'll have a lot to say when I get home.

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.560
Hou-nee? How's it going?

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:30.530
Don't call me. I'm tailing him right now.

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.370
Don't worry. Today's the last 
day we'll see that weird monk.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.130
Stop, you piece of shit!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:37.990
I'm waiting for the right moment.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:42.150
We won't get to see Sei-sama's 
heroic acts anymore!

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:41.900
Give me a break!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:44.640
Our prince was spitting up blood!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.200
How are you going to make up for this?

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.880
Listen to me!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:50.660
He made himself spit up blood!

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.090
It had nothing to do with me!

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:53.510
Listen to logic!

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.310
We don't care about your logic!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.830
Sei-sama is the only truth in this world!

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.320
I'll do anything! Just forgive me!

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:58.640
Stop!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.770
Maybe I should bury all of them.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:09.370
They chased me all day.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:11.200
How have they been training?

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.770
I can't go any farther.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:22.410
I should be able to get some rest here.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.340
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:30.040
Hey! It's Ro Ryou, the guy with stylish glasses 
who's been around since season 1.

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:32.000
I'm about to play a huge role in the show.

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:34.800
What? I'm not in the show 
again starting next week?

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:38.240
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Sutra of Purity."

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:40.100
<b>11: Seijoukyou</b>

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:39.530
Don't miss it.
